      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "For long-term stability, UBI often addresses systemic issues more comprehensively than targeted welfare. UBI provides a stable economic floor, which can reduce desperation and inequality driven by modern economic shifts. Targeted programs, while efficient, can often leave significant gaps and administrative burdens that fail to stabilize the broader society. Your memo could argue that UBI offers a more proactive and resilient social safety net against economic fragility.",
